  "scope": [
    "Opt-in recurring missing-label compensation coalesces the first truly absent matching local label and all matches at the UTC anchor into one delivery.",
    "Restart before the transition retains the pending nominal label and physical execution. A reopened committed exhausted group records one success and gives no replay.",
    "Both package types execute a forward-gap query against the installed package layout.",
    "3,072 fixed-seed comparisons with independently enumerated synthetic offset histories. The corpus validation separately compares synchronous-with-issue, synchronous-without-issue and bounded cursor APIs."
  ],
